{"id": "1530549745800450161", "channel_id": "1510911214346305566", "author_id": "1425265631078645841", "author_name": "megane0965_78083", "content": "幻夢カレン\n10ターン\n\nやっと初回で10ターン…\nカレンは先週来て欲しかった\n\n2ターン目にライカーでバフかけて暗黒料理で行動力増やした上でタイスキーダブルでニム3コスを増やして炸裂させる\n\nやはり侵食が強くなってかなり使いやすくなった。毒パなら確実に発動させられるのも相性良いです。", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T12:18:15.638000+00:00", "thread_id": "1510911214346305566", "edited_timestamp": "2026-07-25T12:18:43.003000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1530549745188343889", "filename": "IMG_9057.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1079928, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1510911214346305566/1530549745188343889/IMG_9057.png?ex=6a65fb07&is=6a64a987&hm=dc9021a65426c5f9b59b7e1dcc5bbf62580e2a1ce3ac3afcde977560c5103119&"}, {"id": "1530549745540530217", "filename": "IMG_9056.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 624242, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1510911214346305566/1530549745540530217/IMG_9056.png?ex=6a65fb07&is=6a64a987&hm=e236361a3d9a1196cddc33648a98f024527c1a13245a5cf3415177553e9b38d2&"}]}
